BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 130.29 Tm (  have passed. The outside air is too HUMID: the dew-point bound is 15.41 C against a) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 117.89 Tm (  15.0 C maximum, failing by 0.41 C. Cool but damp air condenses on cold surfaces inside) Tj ET
BT /FR 9.40 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 105.49 Tm (  the hall, which is why real economizers gate on humidity and not on temperature alone.) Tj ET
